# From "Vectors" (Wave III - Freedom, CD2-3). Reaches Focus 12 by floating
# the REBAL upward rather than the standard ten-to-twelve count -- kept as
# the tape has it, since the balloon-lift is the point of the exercise.
# Directional perception around a clock face: 12 up, 3 right, 6 down,
# 9 left/behind.

@segment  vectors
@title    Vectors
@levels   F12
@duration ~4m30s

say With your Resonant Energy Balloon around you, let it float upward, and you with it, safe and calm.
pause 8
say Let it rise all the way to Focus 12, the state of expanded awareness.
pause 8
say You're floating there now. Perceive in every direction from inside your balloon.
pause 6
say Perceive upward, to twelve o'clock. Remember what you notice.
pause 8
say Now to your right, three o'clock. Observe.
pause 8
say Now downward, six o'clock. Perceive, and remember.
pause 8
say Now to your left, nine o'clock, behind you. Perceive, and remember.
pause 8
say Move your perception back up to twelve, where you began.
pause 5
say Now trace the path forward: from twelve down to three, perceiving as you go. Stop and observe at three.
pause 8
say From three, forward and down to six. Stop and observe.
pause 8
say From six, up and behind you to nine. Stop and observe.
pause 8
say From nine, back up to twelve. You're back where you started.
pause 8
say Now trace it the other way — twelve back to nine, nine down to six, six up to three, three back to twelve — perceiving as you move, slowly.
pause 12
say Relax at twelve, and settle back into the center of your balloon.
pause 6
say Let it float downward now, back to Focus 10, easily and calmly.
pause 8
say You're back. Let the balloon move inward, and reabsorb into you.
pause 8
say Relax, and feel calm and comfortable in Focus 10.
pause 6
